      "source": "Sets whether multi-block system message caching is enabled. When enabled, each\n<a href=\"../../../chat/messages/SystemMessage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.chat.messages\"><code>SystemMessage</code></a> is emitted as a\nseparate <code>SystemContentBlock</code> and the cache point is placed after the\nsecond-to-last block, allowing a static prefix to be cached while the last\n(dynamic) block can change freely.",
